{"3562120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Magical Princess","steam_appid":3562120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4803480],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise the cutest daughter in all of the land in the ultimate parenting simulation!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Magical Princess<\/i>, step into the shoes of a single, widowed father as he brings up his only beloved daughter from early childhood all the way to graduation at the magical academy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.poster.avif?t=1785092195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.mp4?t=1785092195\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With her whole life ahead of her across a variety of different paths, how she grows up and matures is entirely your responsibility. Steer her towards an upright academic career as an ace student, a life of excitement on the stage as an idol, the way of the mighty warrior who takes up the sword, or even pure villainy as the demon queen. With every choice and decision you make, her future changes dramatically!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.poster.avif?t=1785092195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.mp4?t=1785092195\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete freedom to raise your daughter however you see fit. Whether that means letting her attend classes, do part-time jobs, go out on dates, sneak out at night, or even indulge in the occasional thievery and other such &quot;odd&quot; jobs, the choice is yours!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enormous amount of story content  including over 170 date scenes and over 50 endings. Interact with a colorful cast of more than 30 characters brimming with personality as your daughter leads her life at the magical academy.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover deep mysteries lurking beneath the surface. On nights when the full moon turns crimson in the strange phenomenon known as the Crimson Moon, monsters strike in a world seemingly chained to its fate. The key to unlocking everything just might rest in the hands of your daughter...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/6a0c00030d61566f9832b7c74bed43af.avif?t=1785092195\" width=1560 height=1317 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A character raising game fit for a princess!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magical Princess<\/i> is a character raising game where players get to experience the joys of raising a daughter full of potential, bonding with her the more that she grows. What life has in store for her is up to you as you piece together a story of epic proportions! The only question is: are you ready to be a father?<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise the cutest daughter in all of the land in the ultimate parenting simulation!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Magical Princess<\/i>, step into the shoes of a single, widowed father as he brings up his only beloved daughter from early childhood all the way to graduation at the magical academy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.poster.avif?t=1785092195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.mp4?t=1785092195\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With her whole life ahead of her across a variety of different paths, how she grows up and matures is entirely your responsibility. Steer her towards an upright academic career as an ace student, a life of excitement on the stage as an idol, the way of the mighty warrior who takes up the sword, or even pure villainy as the demon queen. With every choice and decision you make, her future changes dramatically!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.poster.avif?t=1785092195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.mp4?t=1785092195\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete freedom to raise your daughter however you see fit. Whether that means letting her attend classes, do part-time jobs, go out on dates, sneak out at night, or even indulge in the occasional thievery and other such &quot;odd&quot; jobs, the choice is yours!<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enormous amount of story content  including over 170 date scenes and over 50 endings. Interact with a colorful cast of more than 30 characters brimming with personality as your daughter leads her life at the magical academy.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover deep mysteries lurking beneath the surface. On nights when the full moon turns crimson in the strange phenomenon known as the Crimson Moon, monsters strike in a world seemingly chained to its fate. The key to unlocking everything just might rest in the hands of your daughter...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/extras\/6a0c00030d61566f9832b7c74bed43af.avif?t=1785092195\" width=1560 height=1317 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A character raising game fit for a princess!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magical Princess<\/i> is a character raising game where players get to experience the joys of raising a daughter full of potential, bonding with her the more that she grows. What life has in store for her is up to you as you piece together a story of epic proportions! The only question is: are you ready to be a father?<\/p>","short_description":"Raise your daughter while she attends a magical academy. Choose which classes she attends, jobs she does, training she undergoes, and more in a character raising sim packed full of story and over 50 endings to reach. How she grows up to be the world's cutest princess depends on you!","supported_languages":"영어, 중국어 간체, 일본어<strong>*<\/strong>, 중국어 번체<br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3562120\/9a68d53118cce7688b92be4070e29a4